guide forever/reputation/darkspear-trolls
title Darkspear Trolls Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Horde
levels 12-60
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Darkspear Trolls, Vehena, cloth quartermaster, cloth donation, Runecloth, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Valley of Trials, Sen'jin Village, Razor Hill, Echo Isles, raptor mount, Zjolnir
reward text Exalted with the Darkspear Trolls
reward item 18788
why Runecloth to Exalted, with the old Durotar quests as a fast extra that pays Orgrimmar too if they still pay in full.

# Built from Forever's quest data: every quest that pays Darkspear reputation,
# with the value from Forever's own quest pages, the world database (quest
# chains, the cloth quests' exclusive group,
# Additional Runecloth's repeat flag), quests.json, npcs.json, items.json and
# the quest notes for givers, objectives, drops and places, and the Forever
# client's Faction and ItemSparse tables.
# Numbers (Forever's quest pages): A Donation of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and
# Runecloth 150 each (60 cloth); Additional Runecloth 50 for 20 Runecloth (the
# same as Classic Era).
# Starting standing (Faction table): Troll Friendly 1000; Orc and Tauren
# Friendly 100; Undead and Skyborne Neutral 2000. No race has a reputation
# bonus. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds 2% a rank, 10% at 5/5: the numbers here
# leave it out. City reputation also gives a quarter to the other Horde
# cities (Faction table: parent Horde, 0.25), except starting-zone quests.
# Darkspear has few quests above level 55: Luck Be With You (Winterspring) and
# the raid and dungeon heads. The Durotar hubs are the same quests as in the
# Orgrimmar guide and pay both cities; they are optional steps (the first step
# of each carries a label; skipping it skips the hub), ranked by reputation
# per minute at full value with the fifth beside it.
# INGAME: grey-quest reputation at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discounts in Forever (Classic: 10% at Honored with the city's merchants; Forever guide sites report 5/10/15/20% from Friendly to Exalted, one says not announced)
# Left out: class letters and race-only breadcrumbs, Threat from Below (150 for
# six trips), Need for a Cure (a long chain), the Grom'gol and Zoram Strand
# quests (levels 19-46, named in the first step for players who level),
# Commendation Signets (only from the Ahn'Qiraj war effort).
# Mounts: the client lets every Horde race ride every Horde mount and puts no
# reputation gate on them.
# ASSUMED: another race's raptors need Exalted with the Darkspear Trolls (Classic rule; Forever's client puts no reputation gate on the items, so the vendor decides). In-game check: a non-troll below Exalted at Zjolnir.

step Vehena: how it works
  tip Darkspear reputation comes from quests and cloth. Vehena, the Darkspear cloth quartermaster, stands in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits. She takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with the Darkspear Trolls also gives a quarter as much to Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and the Undercity. While you level, do the Darkspear quests within 5 levels of them: Durotar at 5 to 12, Zoram Strand in Ashenvale at 19 to 27, Grom'gol in Stranglethorn at 34 to 46. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored the Darkspear merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the raptor vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the raptors: 20 gold for a level 40 raptor, 200 gold for a swift raptor at level 60, once you have mount training. The Darkspear Trolls have no tabard or other reward.
  accept 7833                         -- Vehena: A Donation of Wool, +150

step Everlook: A Little Luck
  zone Winterspring
  tip Luck Be With You is level 60, so it pays in full. Harlo Wigglesworth in Everlook sends you to Witch Doctor Mau'ari, who stands in the same town. The Frostmaul Shards lie on the ground in Frostwhisper Gorge, the canyon at the south end of Winterspring, and the Frostmaul Giants there drop them too (about one in five). The giants are elite level 59 and 60 and stand close together: pick the shards at the edges, pull one giant at a time, or bring a friend.
  level 55
  accept 6606                         -- Harlo Wigglesworth: A Little Luck
  turnin 6606                         -- Witch Doctor Mau'ari
  accept 969                          -- Luck Be With You, +100
  collect 12334 x4 quest 969.1        -- Frostmaul Shards
  turnin 969

step Blackrock Mountain, with a group
  zone Badlands
  tip For The Horde! (Rend's head, Blackrock Spire) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city, the Darkspear Trolls included. Kargath in the Badlands starts the Rend chain: Warlord's Command, Eitrigg's Wisdom, then For The Horde!. Take them when your group goes. The Spider God chain of the Undercity guide (Zul'Farrak and the Hinterlands) pays 225 Darkspear on the way (a fifth at 60 in Classic).
  accept 4903 optional                -- Warlord Goretooth: Warlord's Command, a group of five

step Valley of Trials (optional hub)
  label valley
  zone Durotar
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. The Valley of Trials is the best of them: about 1,400 Orgrimmar and 1,400 Darkspear reputation in 25 minutes (about 280 each at a fifth). Gornek waits in the Den, the big hut; Kaltunk stands outside it.
  accept 787                          -- Eitrigg, in Orgrimmar: The New Horde, +50
  turnin 787                          -- Gornek
  accept 4641                         -- Kaltunk: Your Place in the World, +50
  turnin 4641
  accept 788                          -- Cutting Teeth, +100
  accept 97279                        -- Wayward Weapons, +100
  accept 5441                         -- Foreman Thazz'ril: Lazy Peons, +150
  accept 792 only !Warlock            -- Zureetha Fargaze: Vile Familiars, +150
  accept 1485 only Warlock            -- Ruzan: Vile Familiars, warlocks only

step Boars, weapons and peons
  when done valley
  tip The training weapons lie on the ground in the Den and among the boars to the north. For the peons: target a sleeping Lazy Peon and use the Foreman's Blackjack on it.
