step Burning Blade Coven
  when done valley
  tip Go back into the cave and keep to the right-hand wall all the way, over a small stream, to Yarrog Baneshadow on a ledge above a pool.
  collect 4859 quest 794.1            -- Burning Blade Medallion, from Yarrog Baneshadow
