step Sen'jin Village (optional hub)
  label senjin
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Sen'jin Village and the Echo Isles: about 700 Orgrimmar and 650 Darkspear reputation in 25 minutes (140 and 130 at a fifth). Master Gadrin and Master Vornal stand by the huts, Vel'rin Fang near the water, Xar'Ti south of the village.
  accept 808                          -- Master Gadrin: Minshina's Skull, +100
  accept 826                          -- Zalazane, +100
  accept 818                          -- Master Vornal: A Solvent Spirit, +100
  accept 97225                        -- Forgotten Loa Idols, +100
  accept 817                          -- Vel'rin Fang: Practical Prey, +100
  accept 96821                        -- Legging It, +75
  accept 97223                        -- Xar'Ti: Bloodtalon Matriarch, +100

step The Echo Isles
  when done senjin
  tip Swim to the largest of the Echo Isles, south-east of the village. Zalazane, the idols and the skulls at the circle of power are all there; the Durotar Tigers prowl the smaller islands.
  kill 3207 x8 quest 826.1            -- Hexed Troll
  kill 3206 x8 quest 826.2            -- Voodoo Troll
