  collect 4864 quest 808.1            -- Minshina's Skull: click an Imprisoned Darkspear skull
  collect 277135 x8 quest 97225.1     -- Forgotten Loa Idol
  collect 4892 x4 quest 817.1         -- Durotar Tiger Fur

