step Razor Hill (optional hub)
  label razorhill
  zone Durotar
  tip In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Razor Hill and north Durotar: about 1,800 Orgrimmar and 1,650 Darkspear reputation in 80 minutes (360 and 330 at a fifth). Orgnil Soulscar and Gar'Thok stand in the middle of the town, Cook Torka by the barracks, Furl Scornbrow and Turroc at the edges.
