step Tiragarde Keep
  when done razorhill
  tip The keep is south of Razor Hill on the coast. Lieutenant Benedict is in the keep's only building; his key opens Benedict's Chest on the roof, and the Aged Envelope inside starts The Admiral's Orders. The sailors and marines drop the Canvas Scraps; the Raider's Bow, Battleaxe and Shield lie outside the keep.
  kill 3128 x10 quest 784.1           -- Kul Tiras Sailor
  kill 3129 x8 quest 784.2            -- Kul Tiras Marine
  kill 3192 quest 784.3               -- Lieutenant Benedict
  accept 830 item 4881                -- Aged Envelope: The Admiral's Orders, +100
  collect 4870 x8 quest 791.1         -- Canvas Scraps
  collect 275713 quest 96822.1        -- Raider's Bow
  collect 275716 quest 96822.2        -- Raider's Battleaxe
  collect 275717 quest 96822.3        -- Raider's Shield

