step Thunder Ridge and Razorwind Canyon
  when done razorhill
  tip Fizzle Darkstorm keeps a Burning Blade camp in Thunder Ridge, south of Orgrimmar, among the thunder lizards. A Dull Storm Orb may drop from the lizards: use it to start A Simmering Storm. The supply sacks lie in Razorwind Canyon, north of Razor Hill. Kron's Amulet drops from the crocolisks along the river to the west, about one in ten.
  collect 4869 quest 806.1            -- Fizzle's Claw
  collect 277665 x5 quest 97282.1     -- Charged Thunder Lizard Organ
  accept 97281 item 277661 optional   -- Dull Storm Orb: A Simmering Storm, +100
  collect 4918 x5 quest 834.1         -- Sack of Supplies
  collect 4891 quest 816.1            -- Kron's Amulet

