step Vehena: A Donation of Wool
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before Vehena offers the Runecloth donation, and Additional Runecloth needs the Runecloth donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, Runecloth 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey.
  zone Ashenvale
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7833.1 @36,37      -- Wool Cloth: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four
  turnin 7833                         -- Vehena, +150

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk: the Syndicate in Hillsbrad and Alterac drop it about one kill in three, or buy it.
  level 26
  accept 7834                         -- +150
  zone Alterac Mountains
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7834.1 @57.7,67.6 -- Silk Cloth: the Syndicate
  turnin 7834

step A Donation of Mageweave
  tip Mageweave: the Jadefire satyrs in southern Felwood and the Dunemaul ogres in Tanaris drop it about one kill in three, or buy it.
  level 40
  accept 7835                         -- +150
  zone Felwood
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7835.1 @41.6,85.7 -- Mageweave Cloth: the Jadefire satyrs
  turnin 7835

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth: the Scarlet at Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands, the Gordok ogres outside Dire Maul in Feralas and the Twilight camps of Silithus drop it about one kill in three. The Auction House is faster if you have gold.
  level 50
  accept 7836                         -- +150
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7836.1 live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7836

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Additional Runecloth: 20 Runecloth for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 Runecloth, less what the quests gave you (a troll starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; an Undead or Skyborne at Neutral 2,000 first needs 20 more to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth: the Scarlet outside Tyr's Hand
  turnin 7837 direct optional         -- Vehena: Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 530 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 Runecloth. The Auction House price of a stack decides whether to farm or buy.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7837 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 530 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. At Exalted, Zjolnir in Sen'jin Village sells the raptors to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 raptor, 200 gold for a swift raptor at level 60 (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional live @68,69.5 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7837 direct optional         -- Additional Runecloth, +50
  rep 530 Exalted
  talk 7952 optional                  -- Zjolnir: the raptors
